      "writtenOn": "2018-12-11T16:17:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Craig, the scenario is like that:\n\n- When the meter is not used from a flow (there is no reference for this meter), the system sends METER_REFERENCE_COUNT_ZERO event. \n- When vOLT gets this event, it deletes the meter\n- When the meter is deleted, we get METER_REMOVED event\n- So, I delete it from the related map\n\nFinally, we do not need to update any flow. :)\nPlease note that we do not delete the meters explicitly (from rest API or CLI).",
